===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{chiefly|British}} A [[versatile]] person, able to do many things well; used especially in [[reference]] to being good at [[various]] sports.
# {{cricket}} A [[player]] who is skilled in both [[batting]] and [[bowling]].

